WEBVTT

00:06.506 --> 00:08.925
[sweet airy music]

00:42.042 --> 00:45.336
SEPTEMBER 08, 2011
50 DAYS OF DATING

00:47.130 --> 00:50.258
[Ung] Every now and then,
Yeon-su would ask me really weird stuff.

00:50.341 --> 00:51.718
You ever thought what'd happen…

00:52.552 --> 00:53.553
Hmm?

00:53.636 --> 00:56.264
Like, when I get into college,
but somehow you get left behind?

00:58.057 --> 01:01.186
- I will get into college.
- No, at this rate, I sincerely doubt it.

01:01.269 --> 01:03.063
Feels like that's
what you really want to happen.

01:03.146 --> 01:05.815
Relax, that's not what I want.
It's just a random what-if question.

01:05.899 --> 01:08.359
You'd take the exams again,
after I get in?

01:08.443 --> 01:09.903
Ever thought of that?

01:09.986 --> 01:10.820
[hums in thought]

01:11.863 --> 01:14.115
First of all,
that's not even gonna happen.

01:15.241 --> 01:17.077
But let's pretend like if it does,

01:17.911 --> 01:19.871
then I'd just study
somewhere near your school.

01:19.954 --> 01:23.166
Every day I'll do my studying next to you,
with my own lunch.

01:27.712 --> 01:29.464
You really like me that much?

01:30.673 --> 01:32.926
[cheeky awkward music]

01:33.718 --> 01:36.221
Hey. I asked you a question.

01:36.805 --> 01:38.348
Hey.

01:38.431 --> 01:40.642
Just focus on sweeping, will you?

01:40.725 --> 01:44.896
- We're here to work, stop slacking off.
- I asked you, if you like me that much?

01:45.396 --> 01:46.397
[chuckles softly]

01:47.232 --> 01:48.316
- What's the matter with you?
- Hey.

01:48.399 --> 01:49.901
340 DAYS OF DATING

01:49.984 --> 01:52.654
- What if what?
- [Yeon-su] I was just wondering, what if…

01:52.737 --> 01:54.155
[Ung] Occasionally,
she'd ask out of nowhere.

01:54.239 --> 01:55.365
What is it this time?

01:55.448 --> 01:57.325
What if you secretly went on a date?

01:57.909 --> 02:00.578
Don't be ridiculous.
Why in the world would I do that?

02:00.662 --> 02:02.288
Okay, then what if I do it?

02:02.372 --> 02:03.498
You're going on a date?

02:05.542 --> 02:07.168
- [muffled cough]
- I'm not.

02:07.252 --> 02:09.254
It's hypothetical.
It's just a what-if question.

02:09.337 --> 02:10.797
Ji-ung's gonna spy on you to make sure.

02:10.880 --> 02:13.091
He'll what? Yeah, right.

02:13.174 --> 02:16.344
I think I'll stick to you all day
just to make sure you don't.

02:16.427 --> 02:17.804
[chuckles]

02:19.848 --> 02:21.975
Okay? I swear, I'm being serious.

02:22.058 --> 02:24.811
[Ung] I know you finish class
at 5 p.m. today. I'll see you soon.

02:24.894 --> 02:26.646
Even though we saw each other yesterday?

02:27.147 --> 02:29.607
You know, I'm beginning to think
you really like me a lot.

02:29.691 --> 02:31.317
[Ung] Whatever,
class is starting now. Bye.

02:31.401 --> 02:32.527
- [call ending]
- Hello?

02:32.610 --> 02:35.363
750 DAYS OF DATING

02:35.446 --> 02:37.657
[coughing, groaning]

02:39.409 --> 02:41.286
Looks like it's the end of the road.

02:41.369 --> 02:43.204
I don't know what's gonna happen.

02:43.288 --> 02:45.039
What if…
[coughing]

02:45.123 --> 02:47.542
What if what? Your fever went down.
Stop exaggerating.

02:47.625 --> 02:51.379
It's just a what-if question.
You're the one exaggerating.

02:51.462 --> 02:53.590
What if I never get better and,

02:53.673 --> 02:54.966
what if this is it for me?

02:55.049 --> 02:57.552
What? All right,
stop being ridiculous already.

03:00.597 --> 03:04.434
[Ung] I suspect that Yeon-su enjoys
watching me suffer in agony.

03:05.018 --> 03:08.021
There. You're all better.
Get up and have some porridge.

03:11.441 --> 03:12.609
[door closes]

03:16.571 --> 03:17.822
[Yeon-su] I just…

03:17.906 --> 03:20.825
It's just there was a specific answer
I wanted to hear from him.

03:20.909 --> 03:23.620
1,565 DAYS OF DATING

03:23.703 --> 03:26.080
To be honest, he was a strange boy.

03:26.164 --> 03:27.373
- Hey.
- Hmm?

03:27.457 --> 03:29.042
Are you all done? Do you wanna switch?

03:30.251 --> 03:31.711
I was just wondering, what if…

03:31.794 --> 03:34.297
- Again?
- Yeah, just a thought.

03:35.048 --> 03:37.467
Enough with your what-ifs.
I seriously don't care.

03:37.550 --> 03:40.303
What if I suddenly had to go abroad
as an exchange student?

03:40.386 --> 03:41.846
Did you… why did you sign up for that?

03:41.930 --> 03:43.973
I didn't. It's just a what-if question.

03:44.057 --> 03:46.059
That would be horrible.
Those things never work.

03:46.142 --> 03:48.144
In fact, all my friends
broke up after going abroad.

03:48.228 --> 03:51.231
[Yeon-su] At least, I could feel that
he liked me a lot more than he let on.

03:51.314 --> 03:55.026
What if I get a job somewhere
and they require me to move somewhere far?

03:55.109 --> 03:57.195
Then I'll… I'll follow you
and find a job there.

03:57.278 --> 03:59.530
Or at the very least I'll just follow you.

03:59.614 --> 04:01.032
Why?

04:01.115 --> 04:03.576
Why would you wanna be
by my side all the time?

04:04.577 --> 04:06.704
[Yeon-su] Aren't you tired
of our long relationship?

04:06.788 --> 04:07.747
Huh?

04:08.915 --> 04:11.042
Do you like me that much or not?

04:13.753 --> 04:15.004
[Yeon-su] How should I put it?

04:15.088 --> 04:17.757
He never said the most important thing,
no matter how hard I tried.

04:17.840 --> 04:19.259
- [grunts]
- Ow, hey, don't!

04:19.342 --> 04:21.219
- Fine, be like that.
- You don't have to be so violent.

04:21.302 --> 04:23.638
- Whatever. I'm going.
- Hey. Wait, wait, wait.

04:23.721 --> 04:27.058
Hey, stop.
What are you so upset about? Hey.

04:27.141 --> 04:29.602
- Hey, wait. Stop.
- Don't follow me.

04:29.686 --> 04:31.312
- Hey, wait!
- [Ung] Why did she have to keep

04:31.396 --> 04:34.023
asking me that every single time?
It's so weird.

04:34.107 --> 04:37.068
[Yeon-su] Seriously, there's just no way
he can be that dense, right?

04:37.151 --> 04:39.320
1,670 DAYS OF DATING

04:39.404 --> 04:43.908
And then one night, finally, I asked him
that question for the last time…

04:43.992 --> 04:45.285
It's so peaceful.

04:48.246 --> 04:50.707
- I was wondering what if…
- [deep inhale]

04:50.790 --> 04:52.417
I thought we already banned that question.

04:52.500 --> 04:54.627
This'll be the last time.
I promise you. Just one more.

04:55.211 --> 04:56.879
I have no idea
why you keep doing this to me.

04:58.423 --> 05:00.800
What if someday we eventually break up?

05:05.513 --> 05:08.224
- Not gonna happen.
- It's still possible, though.

05:08.308 --> 05:09.309
Not for me, it isn't.

05:09.392 --> 05:10.643
- Are you sure?
- Mm-hmm.

05:11.811 --> 05:14.314
I mean I could maybe leave you someday.

05:15.523 --> 05:17.483
Like, what if I abandon you?

05:19.110 --> 05:20.486
[sighs]

05:20.570 --> 05:23.281
It's just a what-if question.
I'm not saying it's gonna happen.

05:23.364 --> 05:24.907
Just wondering what you'd do.

05:24.991 --> 05:26.242
- I won't see you.
- [Yeon-su] Huh?

05:26.326 --> 05:29.704
- Ever again.
- Hey, easy. That's pretty heartless.

05:29.787 --> 05:32.415
- You'll never see me again, as in forever?
- Hmm.

05:32.498 --> 05:34.250
What if I find you again myself?

05:35.335 --> 05:37.920
I'll spray water, throw salt,
and then kick you out.

05:38.004 --> 05:40.923
Doesn't have to be that harsh.
I'm not a demon, you know?

05:43.468 --> 05:44.635
It'll be fine…

05:48.639 --> 05:49.724
just don't leave me.

05:50.600 --> 05:54.145
[Yeon-su] That was the first time
he ever looked at me that way.

05:57.231 --> 05:59.025
[Ung] Looking back, I guess maybe…

05:59.817 --> 06:02.070
that wasn't really
a what-if question for her.

06:07.075 --> 06:08.034
You…

06:09.202 --> 06:10.703
[spraying]

06:11.579 --> 06:13.623
[soft pensive music]

06:17.376 --> 06:18.795
[deep sigh]

06:23.174 --> 06:24.133
[sighs]

06:26.844 --> 06:28.387
And what about the salt?

06:29.305 --> 06:31.432
[Ung] Seeing her here
right now in front of me…

06:32.642 --> 06:36.020
[Yeon-su] … just blows my mind.
How did we ever cross paths again?

06:39.732 --> 06:42.276
EPISODE 2
1792 DAYS OF SUMMER

06:42.360 --> 06:45.196
- Hello, welcome sir.
- Hello. It's just the two of us today.

06:45.279 --> 06:47.240
I see. Of course. A table for two.

06:47.323 --> 06:49.492
- Hello.
- It may seem like a hassle,

06:49.575 --> 06:53.121
but I always stand outside to welcome
our customers and usher them inside.

06:53.204 --> 06:54.872
Many of them are regulars here.

06:54.956 --> 06:56.874
They're almost…
they're pretty much family…

06:56.958 --> 06:58.084
Hello, welcome, sir.

06:59.377 --> 07:01.254
Please, if you can just go inside.

07:02.213 --> 07:03.214
Hey, what's all this?

07:03.965 --> 07:06.676
We're filming right now.
It's okay, just act natural

07:06.759 --> 07:09.512
and pretend no one's looking at you.
Don't look at the camera.

07:09.595 --> 07:11.472
- Am I being filmed as well?
- Just act normal.

07:11.556 --> 07:14.016
Please, go inside now. Go on, sir.
Right there. Yeah, go on.

07:14.100 --> 07:16.811
Keep going and stop looking at the camera.
You're staring at it, stop.

07:16.894 --> 07:19.272
[Ji-ung] I guess you must be
a regular here at the restaurant?

07:19.355 --> 07:20.815
- Ji-ung, what the hell is this?
- Cut!

07:20.898 --> 07:22.483
Chang-sik, please. Give me a break.

07:22.567 --> 07:25.278
I'll explain it to you. Just think of him
as some kind of producer.

07:25.361 --> 07:27.363
Act natural and answer all his questions.

07:27.447 --> 07:28.739
Don't be weird.

07:28.823 --> 07:30.825
Pretend you don't know him.
Stop calling him by his name.

07:30.908 --> 07:31.826
[Chang-sik] Oh, I get it.

07:31.909 --> 07:34.537
- I'll just… I'll watch you do your thing.
- Okay.

07:34.620 --> 07:36.289
- Do what you need to do, don't worry.
- Good.

07:36.372 --> 07:37.498
- I'm cool.
- All right.

07:37.582 --> 07:39.667
- Fascinating.
- And action.

07:39.750 --> 07:41.419
- Oh, sorry! Someone man the counter!
- Excuse me.

07:41.502 --> 07:43.171
- Oh, what a hectic day.
- [Yeon-ok] Coming!

07:43.254 --> 07:46.466
Hey, Ji-ung, where is Ung right now?
I could really use him around here.

07:46.549 --> 07:49.010
I told him to wake up early
and get here as soon as possible

07:49.093 --> 07:51.471
to help out at the cash register.
That brat.

07:51.554 --> 07:53.264
I think that
he has trouble sleeping these days.

07:53.848 --> 07:54.849
Why? Has he been sick?

07:54.932 --> 07:56.726
He's still struggling?
How long has it been?

07:56.809 --> 07:58.686
- I thought he's better already.
- Mm-mm.

07:58.769 --> 08:00.980
What's been stressing him out?
Is he eating right?

08:01.063 --> 08:03.024
Is he pulling all-nighters
because of his drawings?

08:03.608 --> 08:05.776
[Ho groans]
That boy! He never goes outside.

08:05.860 --> 08:08.446
Being indoors all the time
isn't good for your mental health.

08:08.529 --> 08:10.948
- Hey, Ji-ung, listen to me, you should--
- No, hold it. Wait.

08:11.032 --> 08:13.201
I'll do it.
I should buy some tonic for my boy.

08:13.284 --> 08:15.244
Honey, listen,
call Yong-tae and ask him to help us.

08:15.328 --> 08:16.287
He can concoct a tonic.

08:16.370 --> 08:18.247
- Okay.
- [Chang-sik] My goodness, you two.

08:18.331 --> 08:19.540
He's not a little boy anymore.

08:19.624 --> 08:21.501
He's a grown man
who can take care of himself.

08:21.584 --> 08:23.920
- He'll figure it out, you're overreacting.
- Shut up.

08:24.003 --> 08:25.338
Ji-ung, what's Ung up to?

08:25.421 --> 08:27.131
Tell me, what do you think
he's doing right now?

08:27.215 --> 08:30.009
Actually, I think he must have
just fallen asleep by now.

08:30.092 --> 08:32.386
I'll visit him after filming later,
then I'll tell you.

08:32.470 --> 08:34.514
Oh, thank you so much.
Yeah, do that. That'd be great.

08:34.597 --> 08:36.015
Yeah. Thanks, Ji-ung.

08:36.098 --> 08:37.600
- Okay, come here for a sec.
- Mm-hmm.

08:37.683 --> 08:40.561
Take care of everything here later
so that I can visit Yong-tae

08:40.645 --> 08:42.897
and ask him for the best tonic
he can come up with for Ung.

08:42.980 --> 08:43.856
And then we can visit…

09:00.248 --> 09:01.582
[deep breath]

09:02.875 --> 09:04.168
- How have you--
- How have you?

09:04.252 --> 09:07.255
I'm sure you didn't come here
to ask me how I've been doing.

09:10.091 --> 09:11.133
[Yeon-su clears throat]

09:14.428 --> 09:15.721
- You look--
- You look

09:15.805 --> 09:18.724
like you're about to tell me that
I look good, which would be a big mistake.

09:19.267 --> 09:21.561
[tense music]

09:23.187 --> 09:25.147
[sighs]
Seeing as you're not getting upset,

09:25.231 --> 09:27.650
I guess this visit's gotta be
something really important.

09:27.733 --> 09:30.945
[Yeon-su] Amazing. How'd he manage
to become even more of an ass?

09:33.823 --> 09:34.740
You see…

09:35.241 --> 09:36.409
Hold on.

09:38.160 --> 09:40.871
Are you… are you getting married?

09:42.415 --> 09:43.374
No way.

09:44.500 --> 09:46.377
Okay. Fine then. Just keep on talking.

09:46.460 --> 09:49.171
[Yeon-su] Although, he seems
to have changed a lot too.

09:51.924 --> 09:54.051
That's you, isn't it?

09:54.135 --> 09:55.928
- No, it's not.
- You didn't even look at it.

09:57.305 --> 09:59.265
I can immediately tell you're lying.

09:59.974 --> 10:01.642
You're Go-oh, just admit it.

10:02.310 --> 10:03.853
- I said I'm not.
- To be honest with you,

10:03.936 --> 10:05.229
I didn't believe it at first.

10:05.313 --> 10:06.939
'Cause there's no way you ever
working this hard in your life.

10:07.023 --> 10:11.027
But the places you chose to draw
I thought they looked way too familiar.

10:11.110 --> 10:12.945
You don't go out much. Easy giveaway.

10:16.741 --> 10:19.577
- They look nothing special if you ask me.
- Plus, you had that interview.

10:19.660 --> 10:22.163
I remember that you once told me
that you don't ever draw people.

10:22.246 --> 10:24.248
It's pretty common for artists
not to draw any people.

10:24.332 --> 10:26.917
Fine. Let's say
these were just suspicions.

10:27.001 --> 10:28.127
This, however…

10:30.755 --> 10:31.922
is proof.

10:32.673 --> 10:35.426
NJ's manager posted this
on his social media recently.

10:35.509 --> 10:37.303
You see that blurry guy
sitting in the back?

10:38.846 --> 10:41.641
That's you
no matter how many times I look at it.

10:41.724 --> 10:43.225
You recognized me?

10:43.309 --> 10:45.269
Go-oh had a reputation
for being secretive.

10:45.353 --> 10:48.397
He never showed up to his exhibitions
or even when he sold his paintings.

10:48.481 --> 10:49.940
But he met NJ in person.

10:51.651 --> 10:54.695
- I'm her fan.
- Hm. Okay. Sure, you are.

10:55.529 --> 10:57.907
Anyway, I'm here to see Go-oh,
not Choi Ung.

10:57.990 --> 11:00.034
Strictly business. I have a proposal.

11:01.327 --> 11:02.370
Really?

11:04.330 --> 11:05.331
Hmm.

11:06.874 --> 11:07.958
Make your pitch.

11:08.626 --> 11:11.212
[Yeon-su] I guess
everyone does change with success.

11:11.295 --> 11:13.297
Look how cocky he is right now.

11:14.131 --> 11:16.467
[cheeky music]

11:25.101 --> 11:26.519
Thank you for considering.

11:26.602 --> 11:28.145
Sir, our proposal is,

11:28.229 --> 11:31.357
we would like to do a collaboration
between Soen Shop and your work.

11:31.440 --> 11:34.193
It's a premium lifestyle select shop,
which would gel with your style.

11:34.276 --> 11:37.571
We were thinking as a surprise
you could do a live drawing session,

11:37.655 --> 11:40.616
as sort of a highlight event
during the opening day.

11:41.367 --> 11:43.494
Would you be amenable to this arrangement?

11:44.120 --> 11:45.079
No, thank you.

11:46.163 --> 11:47.665
- Sorry?
- I said no.

11:49.750 --> 11:51.710
May I ask if there's a specific reason?

11:51.794 --> 11:53.337
I just don't want to.

11:53.921 --> 11:54.839
But still,

11:55.631 --> 11:57.299
if you give us a reason
for your reluctance,

11:57.383 --> 11:58.926
then we can adjust our proposal for you.

11:59.009 --> 12:02.138
No. There's no need for any of that.
It's okay. Thanks.

12:02.221 --> 12:04.807
- Hey.
- Sorry, to whom are you speaking?

12:04.890 --> 12:05.766
The artist Go-oh or Ung?

12:05.850 --> 12:07.852
Are you gonna keep being childish
and get personal--

12:07.935 --> 12:11.021
How could you say that, of course I'm not.
That's why I'm hearing you out right now.

12:11.105 --> 12:12.731
Then why don't you like it?
Is it because of me?

12:12.815 --> 12:13.858
It's a perfectly good proposal.

12:13.941 --> 12:15.943
'Cause, I don't like
being in front of people.

12:16.026 --> 12:18.904
Which you'd know
if you did your research. By the way…

12:19.989 --> 12:21.365
Yeah, I guess it's also 'cause of you.

12:24.034 --> 12:25.744
[deep sigh]

12:26.328 --> 12:27.997
I see you've grown quite a bit.

12:28.080 --> 12:29.540
I don't know.
[inhales]

12:29.623 --> 12:32.626
As far as I can remember,
I've always been a lot taller than you.

12:32.710 --> 12:34.920
Can you please just stop
being so immature about this?

12:38.507 --> 12:41.010
Anyway, if you could please
take a look at this.

12:41.093 --> 12:43.512
- And if you change your mind--
- [Ung] Whom are you talking to again?

12:43.596 --> 12:45.806
- Go-oh? Or Ung?
- Hey.

12:49.477 --> 12:51.812
[Yeon-su] I swear
I should have never visited him.

12:51.896 --> 12:53.689
All he did was humiliate me.

12:55.357 --> 12:58.027
- What are you doing here, Yeon-su?
- What?

12:58.110 --> 12:59.778
I told you to stay away from me forever.

13:02.031 --> 13:03.699
I'm here
in a strictly professional manner.

13:03.782 --> 13:05.242
So just for work? That's all it is?

13:05.326 --> 13:07.077
Getting this proposal
is very important to me.

13:07.161 --> 13:08.037
I don't know.

13:08.120 --> 13:11.290
Doesn't seem important enough
to come find me after five years.

13:11.874 --> 13:14.585
How are you still so upset
even after five years have passed?

13:14.668 --> 13:17.296
How are you so indifferent
only after five years?

13:19.256 --> 13:21.467
[soft gentle music]

13:33.604 --> 13:34.813
What are you doing?

13:35.606 --> 13:36.565
Am I dreaming?

13:38.025 --> 13:41.028
'Cause unless I am, that woman
looks eerily similar to Yeon-su.

13:41.111 --> 13:42.863
Nice to see he hasn't changed either.

13:42.947 --> 13:45.407
What the?
She even sounds exactly like her.

13:45.491 --> 13:47.034
Wow, this is so trippy.

13:47.117 --> 13:49.912
I can't believe I'm dreaming of you
meeting your ex-girlfriend again.

13:50.788 --> 13:53.290
I think we're done here now,
you should go home.

13:55.751 --> 13:56.794
Despicable jerk.

13:58.754 --> 14:01.423
What the hell?
What's going on? Is this for real?

14:01.924 --> 14:03.717
Holy shit, what is Yeon-su doing in here?

14:03.801 --> 14:05.010
[doorbell ringing]

14:05.678 --> 14:06.804
Come on. Get the door.

14:06.887 --> 14:07.930
Oh, okay.

14:16.855 --> 14:18.983
[awkward music]

14:23.320 --> 14:24.196
Who is it?

14:25.823 --> 14:28.826
All right, I'm definitely still asleep.
This is way too messed up to be real.

14:28.909 --> 14:30.828
- It's gotta be a dream.
- What the hell's wrong?

14:30.911 --> 14:32.162
This has to be a dream.

14:34.623 --> 14:36.166
- Oh?
- Good morning, it's nice to see you.

14:37.293 --> 14:39.670
It's okay. That's actually normal for me.

14:39.753 --> 14:41.213
It's been a while, hasn't it?

14:42.089 --> 14:44.049
Yeah, it has, but you didn't even call.

14:44.133 --> 14:46.260
You rarely pick up at this hour,
so I thought I'd just visit.

14:46.343 --> 14:47.845
- [NJ] Can I come in, please?
- Sure.

14:53.684 --> 14:54.518
[chuckles]

14:55.936 --> 14:58.105
So who are all these people in your house?

14:58.814 --> 15:00.941
- Are these your employees?
- Yeah.

15:03.235 --> 15:04.445
I'm going now.

15:05.905 --> 15:06.989
[door opens]

15:11.285 --> 15:14.246
Jerk thinks he can look down on me
just 'cause he's all successful now.

15:14.330 --> 15:16.248
Since when did he become
all high and mighty?

15:16.749 --> 15:18.083
Whoa.

15:18.584 --> 15:20.586
[cheeky music]

15:21.420 --> 15:22.838
[gasps]

15:25.341 --> 15:26.216
Good riddance.

15:27.217 --> 15:28.719
[cheeky music]

15:32.056 --> 15:33.098
[sighs]

15:34.058 --> 15:37.478
[Ung] Well, that was satisfying.
That's one thing off my bucket list.

15:38.062 --> 15:40.564
[scoffs]
How dare you show up here?

15:44.526 --> 15:47.029
What are you doing, man?
Don't keep her waiting. Go talk to her.

15:47.112 --> 15:48.447
It looks like you had
a guest over just now.

15:49.031 --> 15:51.116
Oh, yeah.
I wasn't expecting you to visit today.

15:51.200 --> 15:53.494
Actually, I was a bit thoughtless.
I'm used to being welcomed

15:53.577 --> 15:55.329
even when I'm not expected, sorry.

15:55.412 --> 15:57.289
Don't be sorry. It's all good, I swear.

16:03.462 --> 16:05.339
Hello. My name is Gu Eun-ho.

16:05.422 --> 16:07.257
I'm Ung's manager and his friend.

16:07.341 --> 16:09.426
Uh, you can ask me
if you want to purchase his work,

16:09.510 --> 16:10.803
visit his upcoming exhibitions.

16:10.886 --> 16:14.014
Anything related to him, you can ask me.
I'm the man you need.

16:14.098 --> 16:17.059
So it's Ung?
I guess that's your real name?

16:18.102 --> 16:19.979
Yeah. It's Choi Ung.

16:20.062 --> 16:20.938
Oh.

16:21.021 --> 16:23.857
I have to apologize,
did I come over too early today?

16:23.941 --> 16:25.985
No, not at all.
Feel free to come whenever you want.

16:26.068 --> 16:27.486
We're very accommodating to visitors.

16:27.569 --> 16:30.572
The studio's always open.
All year round, 24-7.

16:30.656 --> 16:31.490
Why would my studio--

16:31.573 --> 16:33.701
If you have any questions,
you can barge in whenever you wish.

16:33.784 --> 16:35.953
We'll unlock the door for you,
even at night.

16:36.036 --> 16:38.247
We're honored someone as shabby
as you came to this precious…

16:39.248 --> 16:42.334
No, you're precious. Someone as precious
as you came to this shabby place…

16:44.086 --> 16:45.587
I'm so sorry.

16:45.671 --> 16:48.340
Don't worry about it.
People often stutter when they talk to me.

16:48.424 --> 16:50.009
[NJ] I'm used to it. It's nothing new.

16:50.092 --> 16:51.719
Can I have a tour of your studio?

16:51.802 --> 16:53.929
- [sharp inhale]
- Of course, you can. Right?

16:54.013 --> 16:55.055
It's okay, right?

16:55.139 --> 16:57.808
Of course it's fine.
Right this way, if you please.

16:58.934 --> 17:00.936
[cheery music]

17:04.648 --> 17:06.734
[Ung] I'm never gonna forget this day.

17:06.817 --> 17:08.610
Truly a gratifying moment.

17:09.111 --> 17:10.154
[NJ] Are you okay there?

17:10.237 --> 17:11.363
Oh, yeah.

17:12.114 --> 17:14.992
- [exaggerated] Thank you for the food.
- No, thank you for eating here.

17:15.617 --> 17:17.661
- Go.
- [loudly] Your food is always delicious.

17:17.745 --> 17:20.539
Oh, my goodness, you're way too kind, sir.

17:20.622 --> 17:21.957
[yelling]
I hope you succeed.

17:22.041 --> 17:24.460
Thank you.
You've been wonderful. Have a great day.

17:24.543 --> 17:26.211
- Goodbye, sir.
- Goodbye.

17:26.295 --> 17:28.047
[Ho] Just keep walking, sir. Keep walking.

17:28.130 --> 17:31.008
I was wondering, how come
you gave me a free fried egg today?

17:31.091 --> 17:33.177
- You don't usually do that.
- [Ho] Thanks!

17:33.260 --> 17:35.429
- [gentle music]
- [Ho] Just leave. Go.

17:35.512 --> 17:37.473
Okay, my name is Ju Chang-sik

17:37.556 --> 17:39.558
- and I own Seoul Hardware--
- Yeon-su?

17:43.896 --> 17:45.314
You never even gave me a warning.

17:45.397 --> 17:47.608
How dare you let me look this ugly
in front of her?

17:47.691 --> 17:49.860
You did it on purpose. You traitor.

17:49.943 --> 17:51.153
[Ung] I know I'm right. 

17:51.737 --> 17:53.947
This is a gratifying moment.

17:54.031 --> 17:55.866
- [sighs]
- [NJ] So I was thinking…

17:55.949 --> 17:57.785
I had been waiting for this day.

17:57.868 --> 17:59.078
[NJ] Excuse me?

17:59.161 --> 18:00.454
[groaning in pain]

18:00.537 --> 18:01.872
She's calling you, you idiot.

18:03.082 --> 18:04.041
Can you draw something for me?

18:04.124 --> 18:05.501
Uh, you mean…

18:05.584 --> 18:07.336
There's something specific
I'd like you to draw.

18:07.419 --> 18:10.297
Uh, I see.
Except, I don't normally draw people.

18:10.380 --> 18:14.051
I usually draw backgrounds
such as buildings or nature, like trees.

18:14.134 --> 18:16.095
It's a building, don't worry too much.
My building.

18:16.970 --> 18:19.223
- Sorry?
- I'd like you to draw the buildings I own.

18:19.306 --> 18:22.184
- Make them pretty.
- Wow. She's incredible.

18:22.935 --> 18:25.354
These days, I find it difficult
to derive joy from my life.

18:25.437 --> 18:27.815
Simply put, I'm always bored,
no matter what I do.

18:27.898 --> 18:29.775
[NJ] When it comes down to it,
this isn't the reason

18:29.858 --> 18:31.902
- I worked so hard throughout my life.
- Oh, dear.

18:31.985 --> 18:34.113
But then when I look at my buildings,

18:34.196 --> 18:36.490
there's this indescribable feeling
that hits me.

18:36.573 --> 18:38.826
I guess you could say it feels refreshing.

18:38.909 --> 18:42.079
I feel more alive, I have an appetite,
and actually sleep well at night.

18:43.038 --> 18:45.290
Looking at them gives me
a sense of reassurance.

18:45.374 --> 18:46.750
I'm glad.

18:48.085 --> 18:50.420
It's the same feeling I get
when I look at your work.

18:50.504 --> 18:53.090
Oh, thanks.

18:59.805 --> 19:02.558
[NJ] Looking at them,
I find peace and balance.

19:03.475 --> 19:06.895
Buildings they're the only things
in this world that remain the same.

19:07.479 --> 19:09.314
Do you also own any buildings?

19:09.398 --> 19:11.817
No, of course not. He's paying month--
[groans]

19:11.900 --> 19:14.695
So what do you say?
Are you willing to draw one up for me?

19:14.778 --> 19:16.029
Think about it it'll benefit you

19:16.113 --> 19:17.990
if they find out
I bought another piece of yours.

19:18.073 --> 19:20.826
Uh, wait a sec. You think it'll be okay?

19:20.909 --> 19:23.871
[Ung] I mean, you're an idol, so…
it could change your reputation a bit

19:23.954 --> 19:26.206
if people find out
that you purchased buildings.

19:26.290 --> 19:27.499
[NJ] I don't care about that.

19:27.583 --> 19:30.669
Maintaining this pristine,
but manufactured image people had of me

19:30.752 --> 19:32.462
never brought me any joy in my life.

19:33.297 --> 19:35.132
If I'm gonna be happy, better start now.

19:35.215 --> 19:36.717
I'll do what I want from now on.

19:36.800 --> 19:37.926
Oh.

19:38.010 --> 19:40.637
Let me have a moment to think about it.
[groans]

19:40.721 --> 19:41.930
It's cool. I'm sure he can do it.

19:43.140 --> 19:44.558
Oh, and I was wondering,

19:44.641 --> 19:46.393
didn't you say earlier
that you were my fan?

19:47.227 --> 19:48.729
Yeah. Yeah, I did.

19:49.521 --> 19:51.398
Well, it doesn't seem like you are.

19:52.065 --> 19:53.984
It's almost like
you're sick of me already.

19:55.152 --> 19:56.528
I'm not sure what you mean?

19:56.612 --> 19:57.613
[chuckles]

19:57.696 --> 19:59.531
It just seems like
you're a bit distracted today.

19:59.615 --> 20:00.741
I don't know what it is.

20:03.076 --> 20:05.329
I've got a knack
for noticing things like this easily.

20:06.496 --> 20:08.790
Oh, I don't think that's why I seem--

20:08.874 --> 20:11.126
It looks like I should get going now.
See you next time.

20:11.210 --> 20:14.379
Oh. Wait, let me walk you to the door.

20:14.922 --> 20:17.132
[gentle pensive music]

20:28.268 --> 20:30.562
[Ung] It's not fair.
Why does it keep bothering me?

20:35.067 --> 20:36.485
[Yeon-su] Childish little prick.

20:37.361 --> 20:39.196
I don't need him to do me this favor.

20:39.279 --> 20:40.906
I still have my pride too.

20:40.989 --> 20:43.659
I'm never gonna let him
humiliate me again.

20:43.742 --> 20:45.285
I seriously hope you weren't bluffing

20:45.369 --> 20:47.120
about getting the artist
to work on this project.

20:47.704 --> 20:49.623
You can't possibly
be that pathetic, can you?

20:49.706 --> 20:50.874
[groaning sigh]

20:50.958 --> 20:53.377
Oh, I shouldn't have overreacted.

20:54.628 --> 20:57.172
Should I let myself go
and beg him just this once?

20:58.840 --> 20:59.800
There's no way.

21:00.384 --> 21:01.843
The guy literally threw salt at me.

21:01.927 --> 21:03.595
[scooter honking]

21:03.679 --> 21:04.888
[gasps]

21:08.558 --> 21:10.769
What are you daydreaming
in the middle of the road for?

21:11.645 --> 21:12.813
Hey.

21:12.896 --> 21:14.690
It's a narrow alley.
You should be more careful.

21:14.773 --> 21:17.192
It's been ages, you know that right?

21:17.276 --> 21:18.777
What brings you all the way out here?

21:18.860 --> 21:22.447
I should be asking you the same thing.
What are you doing all the way out here?

21:22.531 --> 21:24.324
Oh, right. I guess you live here as well.

21:24.408 --> 21:27.411
Don't tell me you're here to see Choi Ung.

21:27.494 --> 21:30.163
Don't even get me started.
I came to see the great Go-oh,

21:30.247 --> 21:33.292
- but instead I got treated like a doormat.
- What do you mean?

21:33.375 --> 21:36.795
Is that guy ever gonna actually grow up?
He's become even more immature.

21:36.878 --> 21:39.965
Let me guess,
did he spray water and throw salt at you?

21:40.549 --> 21:41.842
How'd you know he'd do that?

21:41.925 --> 21:45.053
Because he practiced doing that
on Eun-ho more than 50 times.

21:45.137 --> 21:46.096
What?

21:46.179 --> 21:48.473
Let's just say
he's a lot crazier than you thought.

21:49.224 --> 21:50.392
[sighing]

21:51.184 --> 21:54.521
Funny. I had no idea
that you'd actually see him again.

21:54.604 --> 21:56.523
I guess all that practice really paid off.

21:57.274 --> 21:58.483
I'm getting dizzy.

21:59.609 --> 22:02.362
I can't believe I thought I could
just talk to him. I must be crazy.

22:02.946 --> 22:05.198
- What have I been thinking?
- Why, what's wrong?

22:05.282 --> 22:08.452
It's just, I had to see him
regarding this work proposal.

22:10.495 --> 22:11.830
Forget it.

22:11.913 --> 22:13.915
Not like I'm getting anywhere
with that lost cause.

22:13.999 --> 22:15.292
See you around.

22:17.961 --> 22:18.795
Oh.

22:19.796 --> 22:21.882
Oh, my God, I'm such a ditz.

22:21.965 --> 22:23.717
We haven't seen each other
in ages, have we?

22:25.010 --> 22:27.429
How have you been doing, Kim Ji-ung?

22:28.513 --> 22:30.599
[soft music]

22:38.023 --> 22:39.274
[sighs]

22:40.192 --> 22:41.026
[clicks tongue]

22:41.818 --> 22:43.403
Was I too harsh with the salt?

22:45.280 --> 22:46.698
[sighs]

22:47.324 --> 22:49.326
[soft music]

22:55.082 --> 22:57.375
[Yeon-su] Grandma, wake up, let's eat.

22:58.418 --> 23:00.879
[Ja-gyeong groans]
Oh, that was quick.

23:00.962 --> 23:02.923
Is it already dinner time?

23:03.006 --> 23:04.925
- Uh-huh, eat up and go to bed.
- [groans]

23:05.759 --> 23:06.843
What time is it?

23:07.552 --> 23:10.055
Oh, I need to stay up for the drama,
I don't wanna miss it.

23:10.138 --> 23:12.015
They're not on yet. You have time to eat.

23:13.558 --> 23:16.937
[Ja-gyeong] How could someone
be so beautiful and have glowing skin?

23:17.938 --> 23:21.900
Oh, come on, grandma,
I just washed my face. That's all.

23:22.484 --> 23:25.028
Lately I've been seeing her
on TV more often.

23:25.112 --> 23:27.280
How could her face be so tiny?

23:27.364 --> 23:29.866
It's like she was blessed
by the angels themselves.

23:30.951 --> 23:34.162
Grandma, who do you think's prettier?
Her or me?

23:34.246 --> 23:36.039
- What are you going on about?
- Huh?

23:36.123 --> 23:37.874
You're really starting
to hurt my feelings over here.

23:37.958 --> 23:40.168
I'm your actual granddaughter,
she's a stranger on TV.

23:40.752 --> 23:42.587
And most likely she has a grandma too.

23:42.671 --> 23:44.631
What? What kind
of ridiculous answer is that?

23:44.714 --> 23:45.632
Did you even hear me?

23:45.715 --> 23:48.385
The perfect answer
to your absurd question, that's what.

23:48.468 --> 23:50.387
[Ja-gyeong] Now eat up
before the food gets cold.

23:50.470 --> 23:51.596
Unbelievable.

23:51.680 --> 23:53.473
I can't believe
I have your exact personality.

23:53.557 --> 23:55.934
That's why
I'm so hot-tempered around everyone.

23:56.017 --> 23:58.311
Good. Being hot-tempered
is a must if you're poor.

23:58.395 --> 23:59.980
Don't let others look down on you. Okay?

24:01.940 --> 24:05.193
I guess I've been
a little too kind these days, haven't I?

24:05.277 --> 24:07.320
Maybe that's why I've been feeling like
I've been dragged

24:07.404 --> 24:09.948
- around lately.
- You what? Who's been treating you wrong?

24:10.031 --> 24:12.993
Who was it? Who made
my granddaughter feel all down and sad?

24:13.076 --> 24:14.953
- [Ja-gyeong] Take me to that scumbag.
- [chuckles]

24:15.036 --> 24:16.872
You bring all those bastards
to me right now.

24:16.955 --> 24:19.332
I'm gonna teach those brats
a lesson they'll never forget.

24:19.416 --> 24:21.668
- When I'm through with them--
- You're definitely my grandma.

24:21.751 --> 24:22.836
[laughs]

24:24.337 --> 24:25.964
You just grab this black part…

24:26.047 --> 24:28.258
- Okay.
- …and push it in. It's very simple, right?

24:28.341 --> 24:31.219
- All right, I got it. Yeah.
- Now go bring it outside.

24:31.303 --> 24:33.388
All right. Yup.

24:35.682 --> 24:37.976
- [distant bar music]
- [sniffs]

24:43.440 --> 24:44.649
[Eun-ho] Excuse me, sir.

24:44.733 --> 24:47.444
- Two dark beers for table five, please.
- Sure. Hold on, wait.

24:47.527 --> 24:50.197
Once you're done with that,
just go home. You're all done here now.

24:50.280 --> 24:52.115
Why do you keep coming here
and helping us out?

24:52.199 --> 24:53.575
You're making me feel guilty.

24:53.658 --> 24:56.119
You've been giving me an allowance.
I should do something in return.

24:56.203 --> 24:57.871
And I'm saying you don't have to.

24:59.581 --> 25:01.750
[man] Excuse me, sir,
two more beers over here, please.

25:01.833 --> 25:03.084
Oh, sure.

25:07.130 --> 25:09.466
- [Sol-i] Excuse me.
- Yes, just one minute.

25:11.301 --> 25:14.804
Here are your dark beers.
Two of them. Enjoy your dinner.

25:14.888 --> 25:16.264
Yes, what would you like, ma'am?

25:16.348 --> 25:18.558
- One half-and-half spicy chicken.
- Okay.

25:19.142 --> 25:20.227
And then one chicken salad.

25:20.310 --> 25:21.519
Mm…

25:21.603 --> 25:24.147
One tteokbokki, chicken feet fried rice.

25:24.231 --> 25:25.357
- And this one as well.
- Okay, sure.

25:26.316 --> 25:28.026
Sorry, are you gonna drink those?

25:28.777 --> 25:30.028
Yeah, I will.

25:30.111 --> 25:31.738
[Eun-ho] I'll go and get your order ready.

25:36.159 --> 25:37.160
[camera clicking]

25:37.244 --> 25:39.329
Your food is here, ma'am.
Thank you for waiting.

25:40.080 --> 25:42.499
Tteokbokki and chicken feet friend rice.

25:43.833 --> 25:45.377
You sure you can finish all that?

25:45.877 --> 25:48.296
Sorry? Why would you even ask me that?

25:48.380 --> 25:50.382
Of course I can, don't worry.
I'll finish all of it.

25:50.465 --> 25:52.175
Hmm. Here's why.

25:52.259 --> 25:53.551
- This one is on the house, ma'am.
- [gasps]

25:53.635 --> 25:55.553
These are our crispy tenders.

25:55.637 --> 25:59.015
It's our brand new dish, and it's
the most popular one this month, so enjoy.

25:59.099 --> 26:00.183
Really? Are you sure

26:00.267 --> 26:01.685
- you're giving this for free?
- Of course.

26:01.768 --> 26:04.896
Seeing how much you've ordered,
I can tell these dishes are really good.

26:04.980 --> 26:06.523
Do you have a mukbang channel?

26:06.606 --> 26:09.109
Oh, I think I've seen you
in an online video before.

26:09.192 --> 26:12.779
[gasps]
No, you're mistaken. But thanks anyway.

26:12.862 --> 26:14.572
- Opened a business nearby?
- Yes. What?

26:14.656 --> 26:15.615
It's okay.

26:16.199 --> 26:18.285
It's not a bad thing to size
your rivals up. It's pretty normal.

26:18.368 --> 26:20.787
If you look around,
many of our customers are just like you.

26:20.870 --> 26:22.497
I saw you writing down
something on a notepad.

26:22.580 --> 26:23.665
What did you write?

26:24.249 --> 26:25.208
[clears throat]

26:25.292 --> 26:28.503
Where's your business located?
What's it called? A restaurant? A bar?

26:28.586 --> 26:30.005
I said that you're mistaken.

26:30.088 --> 26:31.840
I don't know
why you're asking me all this.

26:31.923 --> 26:34.634
Why do you have to make me
uncomfortable about ordering so much food?

26:34.718 --> 26:37.095
You see, I'm extremely close
with the owner of this place.

26:37.178 --> 26:40.640
- I can ask him the recipes for you.
- Oh, my God, can you really…

26:40.724 --> 26:42.851
No, why would I want that?

26:42.934 --> 26:46.229
You're wrong about me. What time is it?
I should get going, it's getting late.

26:47.105 --> 26:49.524
- I'd like to pay the bill.
- What about all this food?

26:49.607 --> 26:51.776
You're not eating? If you want
I can pack them to-go for you.

26:52.277 --> 26:54.446
Yes. You can do that.

26:54.529 --> 26:55.488
I'm glad.

26:55.572 --> 26:58.867
I hope you savor the food slowly and
eventually find out what the recipes are.

26:58.950 --> 26:59.951
Good luck.

27:02.537 --> 27:03.580
[sighs]

27:03.663 --> 27:04.789
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

27:11.796 --> 27:15.300
"Super tasty, extremely tasty,
incredibly tasty."

27:15.383 --> 27:16.843
Her business is gonna go under.

27:21.389 --> 27:23.600
[crickets creaking]

27:29.981 --> 27:31.149
[sharp inhale]
Hey.

27:31.691 --> 27:34.819
Why are you sleeping so pitifully?
You're already pitiful, to begin with.

27:34.903 --> 27:37.113
[groans]
I couldn't sleep well this morning.

27:37.197 --> 27:38.948
I heard Yeon-su came by.

27:39.032 --> 27:40.367
Get that away. It's blinding me.

27:42.160 --> 27:44.329
- How did you know?
- I ran into her earlier.

27:45.663 --> 27:47.791
Was it before or after we met?

27:47.874 --> 27:49.292
After you threw salt at her.

27:49.376 --> 27:50.835
[sighs]
Did she tell you that?

27:51.419 --> 27:52.504
No, she didn't have to.

27:52.587 --> 27:54.714
I know you've been
rehearsing that for years.

27:54.798 --> 27:56.007
Have you gone insane?

27:56.091 --> 27:59.260
You're the one who was acting weird and
yet I'm the one who's feeling embarrassed.

28:01.388 --> 28:02.430
[sighs]

28:02.514 --> 28:04.265
I had no idea I'd see her again.

28:05.892 --> 28:07.352
What's it like seeing her again?

28:08.686 --> 28:11.272
Don't know.
Don't even remember what I said.

28:11.356 --> 28:13.817
Well, I bet you said
all sorts of outrageous things.

28:13.900 --> 28:17.028
Hey. Did you come over here
to pick a fight?

28:21.324 --> 28:23.868
What? What're you so curious about?

28:23.952 --> 28:25.245
Well, let's see…

28:25.328 --> 28:26.996
Just wondering what your mental age is.

28:27.080 --> 28:28.289
Oh, stop that.

28:31.000 --> 28:33.002
Hey. By the way,

28:33.086 --> 28:35.296
was there anything else she say?
About anything.

28:36.297 --> 28:37.549
- Hm?
- Not much.

28:39.134 --> 28:40.677
[sighs]
I see.

28:42.887 --> 28:44.848
[soft music]

28:46.558 --> 28:47.934
Let's go inside. It's chilly.

28:50.061 --> 28:51.312
Actually, I'm going home.

28:52.522 --> 28:55.525
What? What did you come over here for?

28:55.608 --> 28:57.110
- Beats me.
- [scoffs]

28:57.902 --> 28:58.862
Bye.

29:01.698 --> 29:02.657
[Ung groans]

29:04.033 --> 29:06.911
[soft music continues]

29:08.621 --> 29:10.832
[crickets creaking]

29:13.126 --> 29:14.294
[Ji-ung] Beats me.

29:14.377 --> 29:15.712
[music fades]

29:18.006 --> 29:19.799
[Yeon-su] Hey, grandma, I'm heading out.

29:19.883 --> 29:21.259
Remember what I told you.

29:21.342 --> 29:24.012
If anyone looks down on you…
[grunts]

29:24.596 --> 29:26.222
Don't you worry,
I'm never gonna forget that.

29:28.016 --> 29:30.727
[Yeon-su] She made everything simpler.
Everything's clearer now.

29:31.728 --> 29:33.688
I should tell them the truth
and not be dispirited.

29:33.772 --> 29:35.523
- Hello, how you doing?
- Then fix the issue.

29:36.775 --> 29:39.235
Ms. Kook, you're looking like
you're in a very good mood today.

29:39.319 --> 29:40.361
[chuckles]
Is that so?

29:40.904 --> 29:42.781
[Yeon-su] I'll tell him
that I can't get Go-oh,

29:42.864 --> 29:45.158
and then I'm gonna propose
an outstanding alternative.

29:45.241 --> 29:46.993
I'll show him
what I've got and impress him.

29:47.076 --> 29:48.661
He won't know what hit him
when I'm through.

29:48.745 --> 29:50.663
[I-hun] Oh, and Mr. Bang is just with--

29:50.747 --> 29:52.165
Hey, Ms. Kook, you're here.

29:52.248 --> 29:53.249
[door closes]

29:53.333 --> 29:56.753
Oh, Mr. Jang Do-yul paid us a visit
early in the morning today.

29:56.836 --> 29:59.172
I heard the project is going well.
We were discussing it.

29:59.255 --> 30:00.340
[nervous chuckle]

30:00.423 --> 30:02.383
[Yeon-su] So much
for showing him what I've got.

30:02.467 --> 30:04.677
Seems like you clock in
very late in the day, Ms. Kook.

30:05.512 --> 30:07.555
[chuckles]
No, that's not it.

30:07.639 --> 30:08.681
All of this is on purpose.

30:08.765 --> 30:11.434
For a more creative vibe,
our workers clock in whenever they want.

30:11.518 --> 30:13.228
It gives them more productive freedom.

30:13.311 --> 30:16.231
After all, creativity stems
from a great work environment.

30:16.314 --> 30:17.398
Sorry, I wasn't prepared.

30:17.482 --> 30:20.151
I didn't expect to see you here
so early in the morning.

30:20.235 --> 30:21.986
We have numerous
important matters to discuss,

30:22.070 --> 30:24.197
and I'd like to attend
Soen Shop's soft launch together.

30:24.280 --> 30:25.698
To gain perspective on our approach.

30:25.782 --> 30:27.951
All right.
Come with me, sir. I'll fill you in.

30:28.034 --> 30:28.910
I think I'll go with Ms. Kook.

30:28.993 --> 30:31.120
After all, isn't she the one
overseeing this entire project?

30:31.704 --> 30:33.832
Exactly, I agree. Going there
with a hands-on staff would be

30:33.915 --> 30:36.376
the most efficient way of doing things.
What are you still doing there?

30:36.459 --> 30:38.711
- Hurry up and go with him already.
- Yes, um…

30:43.341 --> 30:46.135
[Yeon-su] Fantastic,
something I'm not prepared for.

30:52.475 --> 30:54.853
Uh, Mr. Jang, sir?

30:55.770 --> 30:59.315
I was wondering,
did you get home safe that night?

31:03.945 --> 31:05.154
By any chance…

31:06.656 --> 31:07.949
do you not remember what happened?

31:09.450 --> 31:10.285
Sorry?

31:11.077 --> 31:12.662
[elevator chiming]

31:16.958 --> 31:18.751
[bell ringing]

31:18.835 --> 31:20.295
[salsa music]

31:20.378 --> 31:21.337
Ms. Kook, wait.

31:22.672 --> 31:24.674
I think you're a little too drunk,
so slow down and--

31:24.757 --> 31:27.594
I told you. I don't get drunk easily.

31:28.136 --> 31:31.389
Why would you even think
I'd be that way after I…

31:31.472 --> 31:33.766
I'd appreciate it if you walked
in a straight line for a minute.

31:33.850 --> 31:36.895
Why aren't you using your umbrella?
Can't you see it's pouring out here?

31:36.978 --> 31:38.021
Umbrella?

31:39.063 --> 31:40.023
I…

31:40.648 --> 31:41.941
[mumbling]
I don't…

31:43.276 --> 31:46.321
I don't have an umbrella.
[crying]

31:47.280 --> 31:51.242
Unfortunately, I don't have one!
[sobbing]

31:52.201 --> 31:54.621
I don't have an umbrella…

31:54.704 --> 31:58.124
Oh, my God, my umbrella…

32:01.461 --> 32:05.840
[Yeon-su] What… what is this flashback?
Why am I remembering this?

32:06.424 --> 32:07.550
[elevator chiming]

32:15.600 --> 32:16.768
[Do-yul] Are you getting out?

32:17.644 --> 32:19.979
Yes. I am, thanks.

32:24.067 --> 32:25.151
Let's use my car.

32:26.110 --> 32:27.195
Okay.

32:27.278 --> 32:28.154
[car beeping]

32:37.330 --> 32:38.581
[door closes]

32:42.251 --> 32:44.837
- [whooshing]
- [engine rumbling]

32:51.094 --> 32:53.054
Excuse me, Mr. Jang.

32:53.137 --> 32:54.514
Yes, Ms. Kook, what is it?

32:54.597 --> 32:56.975
You won't believe what's happening.

32:57.058 --> 33:00.937
Someone is stealing your car
right now. Call the cops.

33:03.773 --> 33:06.401
He's not stealing it.
He's actually driving the car for me.

33:06.484 --> 33:09.070
Don't worry about a thing, Mr. Jang.

33:09.153 --> 33:12.115
I'll keep a close eye on him,
so he won't get away.

33:13.074 --> 33:14.742
Okay. Thank you very much.

33:14.826 --> 33:16.744
Is she… is she gonna be okay?

33:16.828 --> 33:18.663
Excuse me!
[shushing]

33:19.163 --> 33:21.165
You need to watch it.

33:21.249 --> 33:23.793
Mr. Jang has a nasty temper.

33:23.876 --> 33:25.837
He's not gonna show any mercy.

33:26.754 --> 33:28.756
Now I think
you're just deliberately bashing me.

33:28.840 --> 33:30.925
[quirky music]

33:35.555 --> 33:37.557
You're awfully quiet today, Ms. Kook.

33:38.850 --> 33:41.310
- Sorry?
- What's the matter? Remembering something?

33:42.145 --> 33:46.232
Not at all. I'm afraid I have no idea
what you're talking about. Nope.

33:47.316 --> 33:49.193
- I think you know what it is.
- [scoffs]

33:49.277 --> 33:50.820
No, I don't understand. What you mean?

33:50.903 --> 33:52.655
How much do you remember from that night?

33:52.739 --> 33:54.907
Do you remember mumbling
and ranting about anything at all?

33:54.991 --> 33:56.784
Or calling me a sociopath?

33:56.868 --> 33:57.869
- [distant police sirens]
- What?

33:57.952 --> 33:59.996
[quirky music]

34:01.372 --> 34:04.417
[mumbling]
You think you're a sociopath.

34:04.917 --> 34:05.918
Sorry?

34:07.378 --> 34:11.090
You're a frigid, cold-hearted man

34:11.174 --> 34:13.509
who will walk all over anyone

34:13.593 --> 34:16.554
in his way to achieve success.

34:17.764 --> 34:19.140
You sure you're talking about me?

34:19.223 --> 34:22.852
"I may not be able
to empathize with others,

34:22.935 --> 34:27.565
but I'm a cold-hearted man
who's intelligent and good at his job."

34:28.566 --> 34:29.817
Ms. Kook. I don't think--

34:29.901 --> 34:31.402
Unbelievable.

34:32.403 --> 34:34.238
TVs really can throw you off.

34:34.322 --> 34:37.950
They have a distorted image of people
instead of the truth.

34:38.034 --> 34:40.495
My grandma and I watch this drama,

34:40.578 --> 34:42.997
there's this character
who's exactly like you.

34:44.123 --> 34:45.792
People think they're cool,

34:45.875 --> 34:48.961
but in reality,
they're all a bunch of losers.

34:49.045 --> 34:51.297
- Fake ass bastards.
- [snickers]

34:51.881 --> 34:54.092
Ms. Kook, please.
Don't say anything you'll regret--

34:54.175 --> 34:58.179
No! I wasn't finished!
Stop cutting me off. Will you?

34:59.138 --> 35:03.309
Why do you keep cutting me off?
It's really very rude of you.

35:04.310 --> 35:08.189
How would you like it
if I cut your neck off?

35:09.732 --> 35:11.734
[awkward music]

35:21.327 --> 35:22.578
[Yeon-su] Mr. Jang, I'm sorry.

35:22.662 --> 35:25.456
I sincerely apologize
for everything I said that night.

35:25.540 --> 35:26.415
I'm truly sorry.

35:26.499 --> 35:28.501
So you remember
everything up to that point.

35:29.001 --> 35:30.837
I am extremely sorry.

35:31.420 --> 35:33.214
I am… I don't have any excuses.

35:33.297 --> 35:34.799
I was drunk and I made a huge--

35:34.882 --> 35:37.802
I thought you never got drunk.
That was an incredible display.

35:40.429 --> 35:43.850
Okay. Is there anything
that I can I do for you to forgive me?

35:44.350 --> 35:48.187
No, it's fine. Please just make sure
this upcoming project goes smoothly.

35:49.730 --> 35:51.816
- Well, you see, that's…
- We're here now.

35:57.196 --> 35:58.406
[soft sigh]

35:58.948 --> 36:01.284
Ung. Hey!

36:03.703 --> 36:06.747
- Ung.
- You startled me.

36:06.831 --> 36:09.167
- I just fell asleep. What is it?
- What's this, huh?

36:10.418 --> 36:11.460
What about it?

36:12.295 --> 36:14.839
What is this? I saw it on the table.
Who gave this to you?

36:14.922 --> 36:16.924
Oh, that? Yeon-su gave it to me.

36:17.008 --> 36:18.593
Yeon-su did? No way.

36:18.676 --> 36:20.761
You're telling me this is what she does?

36:20.845 --> 36:23.723
More importantly,
is this the reason she came to see you?

36:23.806 --> 36:24.724
Unbelievable.

36:24.807 --> 36:27.185
Oh, so that's why
she went all the way here.

36:27.268 --> 36:29.187
Makes sense. It's not like
she would've stooped so low

36:29.270 --> 36:30.855
just to come back to see you, would she?

36:30.938 --> 36:32.648
- Right?
- What are you talking about?

36:32.732 --> 36:35.026
- You take her up on it?
- I didn't. I refused.

36:35.109 --> 36:37.195
Are you crazy? Why would you do that?

36:38.446 --> 36:39.822
Did you even read any of it?

36:40.865 --> 36:42.450
No. Why should I?

36:42.533 --> 36:43.367
I don't wanna do it.

36:43.451 --> 36:45.286
She talked about doing
some live show or something

36:45.369 --> 36:48.497
so I flatly rejected her right away.
You know I don't do those kinds of things.

36:48.581 --> 36:50.583
But, you'll be, you'll be drawing
Soen Shop. It's Soen Shop.

36:50.666 --> 36:51.876
So? What is that?

36:51.959 --> 36:53.002
[sighs]

36:53.628 --> 36:56.839
It's a new shop that has launched
in Paris, London, and now over here.

36:56.923 --> 36:59.217
Are you nuts?
You should've said yes immediately.

36:59.300 --> 37:01.969
This is a great opportunity.
You of all people should be doing this.

37:02.053 --> 37:03.054
Why should I?

37:04.680 --> 37:07.308
[Eun-ho] Because Jean Ferrat
designed the damn building. Look.

37:08.267 --> 37:09.310
[gasps]

37:09.393 --> 37:12.396
How did you not know
your favorite architect was involved?

37:12.480 --> 37:13.731
Get off your ass.

37:13.814 --> 37:16.317
Go to Yeon-su this instant and tell her
that, "Fine, you're gonna do it."

37:16.400 --> 37:18.736
Why did you have to act all tough
and throw salt at her?

37:18.819 --> 37:20.404
You're an idiot. You messed up.

37:21.530 --> 37:22.698
Now go over there and beg for it.

37:22.782 --> 37:24.033
WORLD-FAMOUS ARCHITECT, JEAN FERRAT

37:24.825 --> 37:26.160
[sighs]

37:27.411 --> 37:28.788
Damn it. I won't do it.

37:28.871 --> 37:29.872
[groans]

37:29.956 --> 37:32.083
Now I know you're crazy.
You're really opting out of this?

37:33.501 --> 37:36.295
Okay. Wait there.
Let me show you the Soen Shop.

37:38.005 --> 37:39.548
SOEN SHOP

37:40.508 --> 37:43.177
Oh? They're having a soft launch today.

37:44.679 --> 37:45.721
Today?

37:46.806 --> 37:50.476
Let's go. Just go take a look, Ung,
I bet it will change your mind.

37:55.523 --> 37:57.692
[staff 1] NJ. One hour before rehearsals.

37:57.775 --> 37:58.859
Please ready everything.

37:58.943 --> 38:01.654
[Chi-seong] Okay, will do.
Hey, everyone, let's get ready, come on!

38:01.737 --> 38:03.281
Why hasn't he called me?

38:03.364 --> 38:04.865
[Mi-yeon] Who?

38:04.949 --> 38:06.409
You know, that artist.

38:06.492 --> 38:09.912
- [Mi-yeon] Did he say that he'd call you?
- Yeah. I asked him to do me a favor.

38:09.996 --> 38:11.539
He said he'd think about it
and give me a call.

38:12.123 --> 38:13.416
[Mi-yeon] How long has it been?

38:15.501 --> 38:17.169
- About a day and three hours?
- [chuckles]

38:17.253 --> 38:19.588
[Mi-yeon] Come on.
And here I thought it was a big deal.

38:19.672 --> 38:21.132
To you, it's not, but to me, it is.

38:22.049 --> 38:24.343
He's an artist.
And a pretty famous one at that.

38:24.427 --> 38:26.345
These people,
they have a certain way of thinking.

38:27.054 --> 38:30.349
He probably thinks you're a snob,
so he's cautiously taking his time.

38:31.225 --> 38:33.436
No, that can't be the reason why.

38:33.519 --> 38:34.770
Wait, is he handsome?

38:35.813 --> 38:38.149
Not really. Actually…

38:39.400 --> 38:40.651
[chuckles]

38:40.735 --> 38:42.403
He kinda looks like an idiot.

38:42.486 --> 38:45.823
- Well, well, well, exactly your type.
- [chuckles]

38:45.906 --> 38:47.241
Exactly, I know.

38:47.325 --> 38:50.494
Here's someone who's exactly my type,
and he's not even messaging me.

38:54.498 --> 38:56.250
Chi-seong. Is my schedule today--

38:56.334 --> 38:58.961
[Chi-seong] No, it's full.
It's completely packed.

39:00.379 --> 39:02.798
- Can I skip any one of them?
- [Chi-seong] No, you can't.

39:02.882 --> 39:05.801
See, what's happening is you're making up
for what you skipped the past two weeks,

39:05.885 --> 39:07.553
so that's definitely not an option.

39:07.636 --> 39:10.806
NJ. I can see that
you're racking your brain again

39:10.890 --> 39:11.849
over something unimportant.

39:11.932 --> 39:14.810
Can you please not do that, for now, hm?

39:14.894 --> 39:16.979
- For my sake.
- Do you think I should call him first?

39:17.063 --> 39:19.065
- [sighs]
- No, I can't.

39:19.857 --> 39:23.235
Even if he's ordinary,
I've reached out to him too often already.

39:23.986 --> 39:27.823
Actually, since he's an artist,
I guess he's kind of a celebrity too.

39:28.741 --> 39:30.785
So it's no big deal if I call him first.

39:32.328 --> 39:34.205
[distant phone ringing]

39:37.708 --> 39:38.918
[sighs]

39:42.338 --> 39:43.297
Are you going to do it?

39:45.383 --> 39:48.386
- No, I'm not. Why?
- Then why keep watching?

39:48.469 --> 39:51.722
- Because…
- If you ask me, it looks kinda fun.

39:54.475 --> 39:55.309
Why?

39:55.810 --> 39:58.312
Look at them.
They're so lively, flopping around.

39:58.396 --> 39:59.855
What are they like fish or something?

40:01.190 --> 40:03.818
I like their chemistry
and distinct characters.

40:03.901 --> 40:05.903
[Chae-ran] It's perfect
for the early summertime.

40:05.986 --> 40:07.279
They're awkward, young and full of energy.

40:08.114 --> 40:11.325
It's a youth documentary
that's more exciting than most dramas.

40:12.118 --> 40:14.412
I guess it's childish, but it also
talks about the issues

40:14.495 --> 40:16.080
kids their age worry about, so,

40:16.163 --> 40:17.915
I could understand
why the viewers loved it

40:17.998 --> 40:20.167
and why they would wanna
see them again after some time.

40:20.251 --> 40:22.711
All they did was
argue and fight the whole time?

40:22.795 --> 40:24.422
Did you also watch the original?

40:24.505 --> 40:26.257
Take a look when you have time,
you might change your mind.

40:26.340 --> 40:29.677
The original?
When were you even able to watch that?

40:29.760 --> 40:32.388
You were also in it.
I remember seeing you a lot.

40:32.471 --> 40:35.641
- You were rather cute when you were 19.
- Yeah, whatever.

40:36.267 --> 40:37.476
Anyway, take a look at it.

40:38.811 --> 40:40.896
No, thanks. Don't have any time for that.

40:40.980 --> 40:43.315
I'm heading off to shoot some footage.

40:43.399 --> 40:44.400
[Ji-ung] Bye.

40:51.115 --> 40:51.991
[sighs]

40:52.074 --> 40:53.284
EDITING ROOM

41:00.124 --> 41:01.083
[groans]

41:11.469 --> 41:14.138
[sighs]
Why the hell am I doing this?

41:15.890 --> 41:17.057
SBC SPECIAL

41:18.893 --> 41:20.144
[wheels rattling]

41:25.149 --> 41:26.650
[mouse clicking]

41:38.078 --> 41:40.498
[gentle music]

41:53.719 --> 41:55.638
Once we remove the barricades
on the opening day,

41:55.721 --> 41:57.973
there won't be enough room.
You should consider that too.

41:58.057 --> 42:00.434
- [Yeon-su] Okay.
- Hello. Over here this way. I'll show you.

42:02.603 --> 42:04.230
Since the showroom is on the third floor,

42:04.313 --> 42:06.357
the guest should
take a tour through here first.

42:06.440 --> 42:08.067
I'll send you an email about it later.

42:08.150 --> 42:10.402
Should I put these items
where they can be more visible?

42:10.486 --> 42:11.570
So the guests can see them?

42:14.740 --> 42:15.908
Mr. Jang?

42:17.576 --> 42:18.536
Okay.

42:20.538 --> 42:21.622
They're nice.

42:24.708 --> 42:27.127
[Eun-ho] What now?
You still don't wanna do it?

42:28.254 --> 42:30.881
Go inside and you'll change your mind,
I'm telling you.

42:31.799 --> 42:33.676
[bright music]

42:37.179 --> 42:38.597
- [staff 2] Oh. I'm sorry sir.
- Yes?

42:38.681 --> 42:41.225
The technicians are taking turns
inspecting the elevators.

42:41.308 --> 42:43.519
- It'll take about 15 minutes more.
- No, that's fine.

42:43.602 --> 42:44.937
We'll just take the escalator.

42:45.020 --> 42:45.980
Let's go.

42:49.817 --> 42:51.902
Our key features in the store
are furniture and lighting,

42:51.986 --> 42:54.071
put them at the top
of the product placement list

42:54.154 --> 42:55.155
when you create the plan.

42:55.239 --> 42:56.574
Also, please make sure that we'll utilize

42:57.157 --> 43:00.619
all the areas within the shop
as much as possible for publicity.

43:00.703 --> 43:02.997
And please make a list of products
we can place in media,

43:03.080 --> 43:05.624
that can be shown in dramas,
variety shows, or documentaries.

43:05.708 --> 43:06.834
[Yeon-su] Yes, sir, will do.

43:06.917 --> 43:08.043
[Do-yul] Oh and by the way,

43:08.127 --> 43:10.963
- about that collaboration--
- Yo, Yeon-su! What's up?

43:12.881 --> 43:14.925
[awkward music]

43:18.554 --> 43:21.432
Okay, we'll go up there to you.
Just stay there. Wait for us.

43:23.142 --> 43:24.226
I'm so sorry.

43:25.185 --> 43:27.271
It's okay, it's fine.
Do you need some privacy?

43:27.354 --> 43:29.565
Oh, no, you can continue, please.

43:31.734 --> 43:33.068
[Eun-ho] I think she's over there.

43:33.152 --> 43:34.445
- Oh! Yeon-su!
- [Ung] What are you doing?

43:34.528 --> 43:35.362
There you are.

43:36.322 --> 43:37.865
- Hands off.
- I dragged him all the way here.

43:37.948 --> 43:38.907
[Eun-ho] Aren't you glad?

43:38.991 --> 43:41.410
Yeah, now please
drag him out of here, right now.

43:41.994 --> 43:43.245
FYI, I didn't wanna come here.

43:43.329 --> 43:45.998
I heard you wanted to work with him,
so I thought we'd meet up and hash--

43:47.207 --> 43:48.834
You might as well tell everyone.

43:48.917 --> 43:50.961
[awkward music]

43:51.587 --> 43:52.755
[awkward chuckle]

43:52.838 --> 43:54.757
Eun-ho, I'm in the middle
of work right now.

43:54.840 --> 43:57.593
It's okay, Ms. Kook, I can give you
some privacy I'll just wait down--

43:57.676 --> 43:58.844
Oh, no, that's okay. Just stay.

43:59.887 --> 44:03.766
Excuse me, but are you like a friend
of Yeon-su or are you working with her?

44:04.600 --> 44:07.645
Actually, he's the marketing team leader
of the Soen Shop company.

44:07.728 --> 44:09.480
[Eun-ho gasps]
No way.

44:09.563 --> 44:12.149
What a coincidence, 'cause we're
very interested in this place.

44:12.232 --> 44:14.360
Ung, heard that?
He's the marketing team leader.

44:14.443 --> 44:16.028
Stop embarrassing me.
Let's get out of here.

44:16.111 --> 44:17.279
This is only our soft launch,

44:17.363 --> 44:19.073
as you can see it's still hectic
around the whole building.

44:19.156 --> 44:21.575
But I hope you enjoy it anyway.
Oh, if you're unsatisfied

44:21.659 --> 44:22.951
or if you have any suggestions for us,

44:23.452 --> 44:25.496
please feel free to tell our workers
on your way out.

44:25.579 --> 44:26.664
Yeah, sure. Definitely.

44:26.747 --> 44:28.874
Wow. You're very friendly.
I'm never gonna forget you.

44:29.500 --> 44:31.001
Yeon-su, don't forget
to call me when you're done,

44:31.085 --> 44:33.420
and we'll talk about the deal.
My number is…

44:33.504 --> 44:34.713
Never mind. Just call Ung directly.

44:34.797 --> 44:36.632
- Come on.
- Make sure you call him when you're free.

44:36.715 --> 44:38.676
Don't forget to call us, okay, huh?

44:41.178 --> 44:42.554
I'm so sorry about that, sir.

44:42.638 --> 44:45.057
No, it's okay. They're interesting people.

44:49.269 --> 44:50.521
What's the matter?

44:51.438 --> 44:55.067
Uh, honestly I'm just a little surprised
that you weren't offended by--

44:55.150 --> 44:57.486
Oh, because I didn't act
like a sociopath this time?

44:57.569 --> 45:00.072
Oh, no. That's not why.
[nervous chuckle]

45:00.155 --> 45:01.990
- Let's go.
- Okay.

45:03.826 --> 45:05.119
[Eun-ho gasps]

45:05.744 --> 45:06.787
[Eun-ho] Wow.

45:08.080 --> 45:09.998
[Eun-ho] That team leader
has a handsome face.

45:10.082 --> 45:12.167
How can a marketing guy
be so damn good-looking?

45:12.251 --> 45:13.210
[sighs]

45:13.293 --> 45:14.878
Seriously, if I didn't know who they were,

45:14.962 --> 45:16.797
they look like a couple
when they're together.

45:17.297 --> 45:18.382
[groans]

45:19.133 --> 45:22.094
Hey. How could you talk about me
in front of everyone as my manager?

45:22.177 --> 45:24.638
Oh, come on. Who do you think
you are? Batman or something?

45:24.721 --> 45:27.516
Why are you so desperate to hide?
We didn't tell the whole world.

45:27.599 --> 45:29.643
- Shut up.
- Hold up. You're leaving already?

45:29.726 --> 45:31.895
You're not going
to talk to Yeon-su about the thing?

45:31.979 --> 45:33.313
I'm going for a walk upstairs.

45:34.815 --> 45:37.901
Look at you. You're totally
into this place, aren't you?

45:39.736 --> 45:42.489
NJ, deep breath at the count of two.

45:42.573 --> 45:44.533
One, two, now.

45:46.869 --> 45:48.912
Done. Okay. Great.

45:50.414 --> 45:52.541
- Okay.
- [gasps]

45:52.624 --> 45:54.376
- Unzip me right now.
- What? Why?

45:54.460 --> 45:56.503
- Hurry up. Do it.
- Hold on, all right.

45:56.587 --> 45:58.714
There we go. Why? What's wrong?

45:58.797 --> 45:59.798
MR. CHOI UNG
READ

46:00.382 --> 46:01.341
Are you crazy?

46:02.092 --> 46:03.969
How dare you ignore my text?

46:04.052 --> 46:05.095
[Mi-yeon] The artist?

46:05.179 --> 46:07.389
[chuckles]
Looks like you've met your match.

46:09.308 --> 46:11.059
He's probably writing his reply.

46:11.143 --> 46:12.978
He's just being
meticulous and prudent, right?

46:13.061 --> 46:14.313
How long has it been?

46:15.105 --> 46:16.148
Thirteen minutes?

46:16.231 --> 46:18.567
I really don't get
young people like you these days.

46:18.650 --> 46:20.486
[Mi-yeon] It's only been 13 short minutes.

46:20.569 --> 46:22.321
You have the patience of a child.

46:23.197 --> 46:25.782
Then again, he didn't strike me
as the prudent type.

46:25.866 --> 46:27.576
Why does he keep ignoring me?

46:30.078 --> 46:31.079
[soft chuckle]

46:31.163 --> 46:32.539
Take it off, I'm not gonna use it.

46:33.040 --> 46:33.999
- Chi-seong.
- [Chi-seong] Yes?

46:34.082 --> 46:35.584
She's at it again. Please talk to her.

46:35.667 --> 46:38.253
What? What is it this time? Tell me.

46:38.337 --> 46:40.631
I can skip the rehearsal.
I don't need to do it.

46:40.714 --> 46:42.049
I need to go out for a bit.

46:45.302 --> 46:46.345
[button beeps]

46:56.063 --> 46:57.648
Sir, I have to tell you something.

46:58.148 --> 47:00.359
It's about the opening event plan.

47:00.442 --> 47:02.569
- Go ahead, I'm listening.
- [soft chuckle]

47:02.653 --> 47:06.156
You know that plan about the collaboration
with the artist I told you about?

47:06.240 --> 47:07.282
Yes.

47:08.116 --> 47:10.410
I don't think it'll pan out anymore.

47:13.080 --> 47:14.206
Why not?

47:14.289 --> 47:16.708
I wasn't able to contact him
no matter how hard I tried.

47:16.792 --> 47:18.710
And through my extensive research on him,

47:18.794 --> 47:21.964
we hit a roadblock. I found out that
he doesn't want to be seen in public.

47:24.424 --> 47:26.677
- Ms. Kook, listen--
- I know you're disappointed about this.

47:26.760 --> 47:28.095
However, I'm truly sorry.

47:28.178 --> 47:30.764
In any case, I promise
that I'll come up with something else.

47:30.847 --> 47:32.140
A better alternative.

47:35.102 --> 47:37.396
I guess you really don't remember
what happened at the end.

47:37.479 --> 47:38.313
What?

47:38.397 --> 47:40.482
You remember up until
you called me a sociopath,

47:40.566 --> 47:41.400
but it didn't end there.

47:41.483 --> 47:43.944
You don't remember about
what happened in front of your house?

47:44.653 --> 47:46.446
I don't get you.

47:48.282 --> 47:50.158
[bright music]

47:50.701 --> 47:51.994
[sighs]

47:54.705 --> 47:57.040
I found out who Go-oh is.

48:00.294 --> 48:03.297
[Yeon-su] Because I didn't want you
to look down on me.

48:04.381 --> 48:06.133
That's actually really great news.

48:06.842 --> 48:09.219
I really hoped it wasn't him.

48:10.304 --> 48:13.223
I really didn't expect it to be him.

48:14.308 --> 48:15.350
Sorry?

48:15.434 --> 48:17.352
How do I do this…

48:17.436 --> 48:20.564
How can I possibly see him again?

48:21.732 --> 48:23.025
[Yeon-su hiccups]

48:23.108 --> 48:24.526
I don't get what you mean.

48:24.610 --> 48:27.446
[Yeon-su sniffling]
How am I gonna handle it?

48:28.071 --> 48:29.448
[sniffs]

48:29.531 --> 48:33.744
Seeing that jerk, Choi Ung,
after all this time?

48:39.124 --> 48:40.459
You don't mean Go-oh, right?

48:41.293 --> 48:42.377
You personally know him?

48:43.545 --> 48:46.673
[Yeon-su] It's been five years
since we broke up.

48:49.968 --> 48:51.094
Hey.

48:52.387 --> 48:53.680
Hello, Ms. Kook?

48:53.764 --> 48:56.266
Out of everyone in the world…

48:58.226 --> 49:00.562
Why did it have to be Ung?

49:00.646 --> 49:02.856
How am I supposed to face him?

49:05.108 --> 49:07.152
[Yeon-su] What the? Son of a bitch!

49:07.235 --> 49:09.196
What in the world did I tell him?

49:14.618 --> 49:15.869
[inhales]

49:16.453 --> 49:18.872
- That guy just now was Go-oh, wasn't he?
- You see--

49:18.955 --> 49:20.874
[Do-yul] He seems to know
about this project.

49:20.957 --> 49:23.126
Okay, if you're uncomfortable
about working with him on this,

49:23.210 --> 49:26.296
we're willing to replace you with someone
who's more capable of handling it

49:26.380 --> 49:27.798
and proceed with the original plan.

49:27.881 --> 49:29.966
- But sir, it's--
- I'm saying, since you were in charge

49:30.050 --> 49:32.928
from the get-go it'd be great
if you stayed on board to see it through.

49:33.011 --> 49:36.098
However, we have no choice if you can't
put your personal feelings aside.

49:36.181 --> 49:37.683
- [staff 3] Mr. Jang.
- Just one minute.

49:37.766 --> 49:39.351
You're done for today, so you can leave.

49:39.434 --> 49:42.145
Let me know if anything comes up.
You have my number. Goodbye.

49:42.229 --> 49:43.897
- [Do-yul] Yes?
- [staff 3] Can you check this?

49:43.980 --> 49:45.315
[Do-yul] Oh, that looks fine.

49:48.902 --> 49:51.613
[sighs]
[Yeon-su] What should I do now?

49:56.827 --> 50:00.580
Oh, no. What am I supposed to do?

50:03.667 --> 50:04.918
Going in?

50:10.841 --> 50:11.842
[sighs]

50:13.552 --> 50:14.636
[button beeps]

50:19.433 --> 50:21.017
[both sigh]

50:27.065 --> 50:28.108
Where is Eun-ho?

50:28.942 --> 50:30.110
Somewhere downstairs.

50:32.821 --> 50:33.989
[rattling]

50:34.990 --> 50:36.408
Whoa.

50:38.160 --> 50:40.787
Right. They said they were
inspecting the elevators.

50:41.788 --> 50:42.622
[sighs]

50:42.706 --> 50:43.707
EMERGENCY CALL

50:43.790 --> 50:46.209
We're stuck in elevator nine.
Please send assistance.

50:50.464 --> 50:53.425
- It won't take long, don't worry.
- You don't look too surprised.

50:53.508 --> 50:54.968
Is there a reason that I should be?

50:57.763 --> 50:58.638
[clears throat]

51:04.853 --> 51:07.481
Thought you said you weren't interested.
What changed?

51:07.564 --> 51:08.982
I read the proposal today.

51:09.065 --> 51:11.568
I knew it. You didn't even bother
reading it that day.

51:13.945 --> 51:16.948
It blows my mind. How are you
still so immature after all these years?

51:17.032 --> 51:19.534
With the water and the salt,
I heard you rehearsed that several times.

51:19.618 --> 51:22.412
- Did Ji-ung tell you that?
- Just grow up, will you?

51:22.496 --> 51:24.498
Seriously, that's all you could think of?

51:27.626 --> 51:28.919
What about you?

51:29.419 --> 51:31.588
Was that the only excuse
you could think of after five years?

51:39.179 --> 51:42.307
Then what excuse were you expecting
to hear when you saw me outside your door?

51:44.184 --> 51:46.311
[sentimental tense music]

51:51.149 --> 51:54.361
[Yeon-su] One thing was for sure,
I wasn't gonna be childish like you.

51:54.444 --> 51:55.946
After all, it had been five years already.

52:02.744 --> 52:04.746
What if I had stopped behaving childishly?

52:07.457 --> 52:08.834
Would you have stayed with me?

52:09.876 --> 52:12.003
[sentimental music]

52:17.384 --> 52:19.803
If you were being sincere back then,

52:19.886 --> 52:21.847
tell me, what would you have done?

52:24.933 --> 52:27.936
[sentimental music continues]

52:38.488 --> 52:40.866
I'm sorry. They must have
made a mistake during the inspection.

52:40.949 --> 52:42.450
No, it's okay. Thank you.

52:44.619 --> 52:47.372
[sentimental music]

53:00.510 --> 53:01.970
[Ung] I really am childish.

53:03.179 --> 53:04.472
I just ran away.

53:14.316 --> 53:15.400
[NJ] How's it going?

53:17.235 --> 53:18.236
Oh.

53:18.987 --> 53:20.655
NJ, hey, what are you doing here?

53:20.739 --> 53:23.199
- Do you know where your phone is?
- Where my phone is?

53:23.783 --> 53:25.035
It's right here in my pocket.

53:25.535 --> 53:28.413
Oh, so you didn't lose it after all.

53:28.496 --> 53:30.123
Then why have you been ignoring me?

53:30.749 --> 53:33.835
Oh, that. I turned it off
because I wanted a bit more time to think

53:33.919 --> 53:35.795
what I'd say to you,
you know, before replying.

53:35.879 --> 53:37.505
[NJ] So you put off my text?

53:37.589 --> 53:39.966
I'm curious,
what were you doing that time?

53:40.050 --> 53:41.593
I was… I went out somewhere.

53:42.260 --> 53:44.512
What about you?
What are you doing around here?

53:44.596 --> 53:45.889
Do you have, like, an event here?

53:45.972 --> 53:48.892
No reason. I was just wondering
why you were ignoring me.

53:49.684 --> 53:52.812
But… aren't you really busy?
Don't you have a packed schedule?

53:53.313 --> 53:56.107
I do, I'll be leaving in five minutes.
I have a live stage scheduled.

53:56.191 --> 53:58.318
I just had a bit of free time to kill.

53:58.985 --> 54:01.696
- So you came here?
- I'm usually too busy to feel bored,

54:01.780 --> 54:03.782
fortunately, things have
changed a lot these days.

54:04.366 --> 54:08.536
I wanted to see what you were so busy with
instead of replying to my text.

54:08.620 --> 54:09.496
What?

54:10.288 --> 54:12.207
Um, you know, you're very…

54:14.084 --> 54:15.210
What should I say?

54:15.961 --> 54:17.087
I'll just use the word unique.

54:17.170 --> 54:18.588
I'm running late. You take care.

54:18.672 --> 54:21.424
Hold on, is that why you came
all the way out here? To check up on me?

54:21.508 --> 54:24.302
You wanna find out?
Easy, just ignore my text again.

54:24.886 --> 54:25.720
[NJ] Let's go.

54:31.142 --> 54:32.310
[chuckles]

54:34.187 --> 54:36.398
[chuckling on screen]

54:37.774 --> 54:39.067
SBC SPECIAL
HWIYEONG HIGH SCHOOL

54:45.031 --> 54:46.491
[Ung on screen] Hey! Whoa!

54:51.454 --> 54:52.497
[mouse clicking]

54:59.045 --> 55:00.839
[laughter on screen]

55:08.888 --> 55:10.056
[sighs]

55:16.438 --> 55:17.772
[dial tone]

55:21.026 --> 55:21.943
Hello.

55:23.194 --> 55:25.572
Okay, I'll do it. I'm in.

55:27.824 --> 55:30.493
["Drawer" by 10cm playing]

56:56.371 --> 56:57.497
[exhales]

57:14.514 --> 57:15.890
SBC SPECIAL

57:21.479 --> 57:23.982
[Ung and Yeon-su laughing on screen]

57:30.780 --> 57:32.574
What? What do you want me to do?

57:33.992 --> 57:35.493
- What?
- You don't have a choice.

57:36.911 --> 57:39.205
[groans]
Don't annoy me so early in the morning.

57:40.206 --> 57:42.959
I need to do it, and that means so do you.

57:43.042 --> 57:45.378
- Does my Dad wanna film me too?
- [Ji-ung] No, that's not it.

57:46.254 --> 57:47.338
You and Yeon-su.

57:48.006 --> 57:50.592
Just like before. A documentary.

57:51.217 --> 57:53.261
["Why" by Janet Suhh playing]

57:59.017 --> 58:00.935
Are you insane? What drugs are you on?

58:01.019 --> 58:03.229
Think I'm some kind
of a doormat you can step on?

58:05.106 --> 58:07.692
Hello everyone, I'm Choi Ung.
It's nice to meet you.

58:07.775 --> 58:09.152
EPILOGUE

58:09.235 --> 58:10.403
[deep inhale]

58:10.487 --> 58:11.905
My name is…

58:15.909 --> 58:18.786
[Yeon-su groans]
Are we seriously gonna do this again?

58:22.165 --> 58:23.124
[sighs]

58:25.835 --> 58:27.795
[whistles]

58:32.133 --> 58:39.140
1792 DAYS OF SUMMER

58:41.267 --> 58:44.020
[upbeat music]

58:54.489 --> 58:56.741
[Ji-ung] Think about it, why would people
decide to star in a documentary?

58:56.824 --> 58:58.034
There's a good reason.

58:58.117 --> 58:59.827
My skin used to be so elastic.

58:59.911 --> 59:00.995
[Ung sighs]

59:01.079 --> 59:03.039
The things I hate?
Yeah, it's still Kook Yeon-su.

59:03.122 --> 59:06.084
[Eun-ho] To put Ung and Yeon-su together
after what they've been through…

59:06.167 --> 59:07.585
Wouldn't that be a little too disastrous?

59:07.669 --> 59:08.962
Wait. Wait. My crutch!

59:09.712 --> 59:12.924
Why would I?
You mean absolutely nothing to me. Zero.

59:13.007 --> 59:15.593
I've never met anyone so selfish,
she's so full of herself.

59:15.677 --> 59:17.178
[Yeon-su] All right,
let's see who wins this.

59:17.262 --> 59:20.932
How precious it is to be able to capture
and store a moment in your life.

59:21.015 --> 59:22.517
[Ji-ung] Just be honest with me.

59:22.600 --> 59:24.269
Does none of that
really mean anything to you?
